{"title":"2024 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Apex_STEM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Apex STEM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Faster_computation)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Faster computation)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Just_Math⚡\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Just Math⚡</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Zelda played the <i>Adventures of Math</i> game on August 1 and scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77337ee705330752b3b28ec738c83d09b8aa02f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1700$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> points. She continued to play daily over the next <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> days. The bar chart below shows the daily change in her score compared to the day before. (For example, Zelda's score on August 2 was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/0/ce0e76ff4b0814e40b423031759102c380f97388.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1700 + 80 = 1780$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" /> points.) What was Zelda's average score in points over the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> days?<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:Screenshot_2024-11-08_1.51.51_PM.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/e/e6/Screenshot_2024-11-08_1.51.51_PM.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"560\" height=\"237\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/f/e4f9954f9026122ea9c68e20dea5ffa7099b003f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)} 1700\\qquad\\textbf{(B)} 1702\\qquad\\textbf{(C)} 1703\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}1713\\qquad\\textbf{(E)} 1715$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"460\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Going through the table, we see her scores over the six days were: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/7/e77337ee705330752b3b28ec738c83d09b8aa02f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1700$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/a/61abe8d7f594a3cd9d31c9ffddd577178e5cbf26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1700+80=1780$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/5/94529a9da1960c91721f1a16b6961a64350b22d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1780-90=1690$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/d/17dbe51221406a35eb018752e9a725d284ae4b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1690-10=1680$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d32ec24a94c47d9bf1739a80ca34b275f03141e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1680+60=1740$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/5/ed565649fd2529a6474d5b00612e55442a901ec9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1740-40=1700$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Taking the average, we get  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/f/66f6be6b07d7f513648490fe28787826e36a8f89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(1700+1780+1690+1680+1740+1700)}{6} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 1715}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"460\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>-i_am_suk_at_math_2\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Compared to the first day <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/2/212189b40cc8e691165d16dff408410dbef49946.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1700)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"52\" height=\"20\" />, her scores change by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/9/249313bc494e31621974c53037762b93cde89077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/7/d7701e9469f26e22c106341791344b28f3196443.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f1588c7ab561762e3d7b81887b584140570fd01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-20$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/2/ba22d9ca92196a02b6c9d831fd463db4ca33c16f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/3/a131aa653ac72b1d84be5ec3130dc57335036c9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />. So, the average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/8/4c86d06b0891cc941d8f08bd3e48b7cfbfbf41ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1700 + \\frac{80-10-20+40+0}{6} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }1715}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"341\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Sidenote: Many people would just add up the changes, which would give them 1700. That is wrong.\n</p><p>-mathfun2012\n</p><p>-JK2030 minor edit\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As the scores of each day are dependent on previous days, we get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/a/69afd413f6d1523972b04188fe15d66aba77378d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1700 + \\dfrac{0\\cdot6 + 80\\cdot5 + (-90)\\cdot4 + (-10)\\cdot3 + 60\\cdot2 + (-40)\\cdot1}{6} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }1715}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"599\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>~NSAoPS\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> as 1700, we get the variables as: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1ad23c12e3e25124757333cbc9054f00d4a5f017.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df81c26136de2de8278f866acc72e6cf0c171bac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/8/8885926ae94944b77ab85bc7260ca1d9027c3b26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817013056030750dac81c5fdf385723e8b7d3e9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.  \nFinding the average of this gets us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/5/ac58e2faa914d9a716f3de87ab97092a7f8338b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{6x + 90}{6} = x + 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"141\" height=\"38\" />.  \nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is 1700, we get our answer as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/2/6c299b92c5dfcb00911bf67fc00d8e70c5a842b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1700 + 15 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }1715}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"184\" height=\"30\" />  \n</p><p>~Ninjago_342  \n</p><p>~LATEX-ed by SEAN2022NAES\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Apex_STEM\">Video Solution by Apex STEM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Apex STEM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/kD5VcJWCF0c\">https://youtu.be/kD5VcJWCF0c</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28Faster_computation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(Faster_computation)\">Video Solution(Faster computation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(Faster computation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I\">https://youtu.be/l3VrUsZkv8I</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Pi_Academy\">Video Solution by Pi Academy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Pi Academy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ABkKz0gS1MU?si=ZQBgDMRaJmMPSSMM\">https://youtu.be/ABkKz0gS1MU?si=ZQBgDMRaJmMPSSMM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution 1 by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mfTDSXH9j2g\">https://youtu.be/mfTDSXH9j2g</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/t8Dpj7dHZ3s\">https://youtu.be/t8Dpj7dHZ3s</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/uOMi6GISNLg?si=UbAI9jSq52yXNAAV\">https://youtu.be/uOMi6GISNLg?si=UbAI9jSq52yXNAAV</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Just_Math.E2.9A.A1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Just_Math⚡\">Video Solution by Just Math⚡</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Just Math⚡\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span>